('B2','phyllostachys_praecox_monoculture_2018','10.1080/15226514.2017.1374339','Comparison... Phyllostachys praecox and Sedum','Phyllostachys praecox','UNRESOLVED','polluted soil origin unresolved','unresolved','not numerically accessible','unresolved','unresolved','possible lineage with confirmed overlap','yes','Full methods/BCF inaccessible; possible shared study.'),
('B3','phyllostachys_praecox_cultivation_time_2020','10.1016/S1002-0160(20)60033-9','Effect of cultivation time...','Phyllostachys praecox','UNRESOLVED','field chronosequence; origin partly resolved','field','unavailable','unavailable','likely yes','not fully assessable','yes','No plant BCF data accessible.'),
